---
// Interactive transaction isolation stepper: wraps TxIsolationDemo in DemoFrame
// with bilingual caption and scoped styles using the txi- prefix.
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
import TxIsolationDemo from '../demos/TxIsolationDemo.tsx';
---
<figure class="txi-figure">
  <DemoFrame title="Step through isolation levels and race conditions" titleVi="Chạy từng bước các mức isolation và lỗi tranh chấp">
    <TxIsolationDemo client:visible />
  </DemoFrame>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Pick a concurrency anomaly and an isolation level, then step through T1 and T2. Notice how Read Committed changes snapshots between statements, Snapshot Isolation freezes a single snapshot per transaction (allowing write skew on disjoint rows), 2PL blocks and breaks deadlocks, and SSI catches cycles with non-blocking SIREAD tripwires.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Chọn một lỗi tranh chấp và một mức cô lập, rồi bấm từng bước để xem T1 và T2 chạy. Để ý cách Read Committed đổi snapshot giữa các câu truy vấn, Snapshot Isolation giữ một snapshot suốt giao dịch (nên vẫn lọt write skew khi sửa khác dòng), 2PL chặn và cắt deadlock, còn SSI bắt vòng xung đột bằng bẫy SIREAD không chặn.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .txi-figure {
    margin: 2em 0;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .txi-figure > .demo-frame {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .txi-figure > figcaption {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .txi .sd-group > span,
  .txi .sd-stat span {
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .txi .sd-stat b span {
    font-size: inherit;
    font-weight: inherit;
    color: inherit;
  }
  .txi-stat-text {
    font-size: 14px !important;
    line-height: 1.35 !important;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .txi-step-nav {
    margin-left: auto;
  }
  .txi-msg {
    min-height: 2.8em;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    padding: 9px 12px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg-alt);
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--text-body);
  }
  .txi-cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(270px, 100%), 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .txi-h {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .txi-tx-badges {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .txi-tx {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 2px 9px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg-alt);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .txi-tx.is-active {
    border-color: var(--text-muted);
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .txi-tx.is-waiting {
    border-color: var(--gold);
    background: var(--gold-tint-bg);
    color: var(--gold-icon);
  }
  .txi-tx.is-aborted {
    border-color: var(--red);
    background: var(--red-tint-bg);
    color: var(--red);
  }
  .txi-tx.is-committed {
    border-color: #16a34a;
    color: #15803d;
  }
  html[data-theme='dark'] .txi-tx.is-committed {
    color: #4ade80;
  }
  .txi-steps {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .txi-step {
    width: 100%;
    text-align: left;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--bg-alt);
    color: var(--text-body);
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .txi-step.is-pending {
    opacity: 0.52;
  }
  .txi-step.is-current {
    border-color: var(--text-muted);
    background: var(--card-bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .txi-step.is-current.is-bad {
    border-color: var(--red);
    background: var(--red-tint-bg);
  }
  .txi-step-num {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .txi-step.is-current .txi-step-num {
    border-color: var(--text);
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .txi-step.is-current.is-bad .txi-step-num {
    border-color: var(--red);
    color: var(--red);
  }
  .txi-step-actor {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .txi-step-text {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
  }
  .txi-box {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--bg-alt);
  }
  .txi-box-title {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .txi-rows {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .txi-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 6px 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--card-bg);
  }
  .txi-row-key {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .txi-vers {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .txi-ver {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 2px 7px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg-alt);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-body);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .txi-ver small {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .txi-ver.is-uncommitted {
    border-style: dashed;
    border-color: var(--gold);
    background: var(--gold-tint-bg);
  }
  .txi-ver.is-aborted {
    opacity: 0.6;
    text-decoration: line-through;
    border-color: var(--red);
  }
  .txi-seen {
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .txi-none {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }
  .txi-locks {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 5px;
  }
  .txi-lock {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 5px 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--card-bg);
    font-size: 12.5px;
  }
  .txi-lock.is-x,
  .txi-lock.is-rw {
    border-color: var(--red);
    background: var(--red-tint-bg);
  }
  .txi-lock.is-siread {
    border-style: dashed;
    border-color: var(--gold);
    background: var(--gold-tint-bg);
  }
  .txi-lock-kind {
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg-alt);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .txi-lock-holder {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .txi-lock-target {
    color: var(--text-body);
  }
</style>
